[00:36.29] I have been thinking
[00:41.95] About my life lately
[00:47.84] These old streets
[00:50.44] This same old song
[00:52.74] Of smoke and mirrors
[00:58.24] And sweet, sweet revenge
[01:06.08] Sigh my heart
